    clientScriptServiceDesc.doc = "This scene's player code (ADR 0105): its HUD, its menu's buttons, a camera. A `Script` here runs on every machine a player sits at -- solo, a host, a client that joined -- and **never on a dedicated server**. It is not replicated: each client runs its own, from its own package.\012\012At boot every `src/scenes/<scene>/client/**/*.luau` file becomes a `Script` under it. It belongs to the scene, and goes when the scene does.";
